 ### Data Structures
-*   **Volume Texture**: 3D array of scalar values [S4, S3, unofficial]. In WebGL implementations, sampled using `texture(volume, p)` [S4, unofficial].
-*   **Transfer Function**: 2D texture where the x-coordinate is the scalar value and y-coordinate is fixed (e.g., 0.5) [S4, unofficial]. Output is RGBA. In some implementations, the alpha channel is ignored and the sampled scalar value itself is used as opacity [S4, unofficial].
